OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are 3,000 fridges piling up in
OL,4,ANorfolk?
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Murrell, assistant director for
OL,7,Fwaste at the council, said: "We don't
OL,8,Fwant to see fridges and freezers stored
OL,9,Flike this, they need to be managed
OL,10,Fproperly through that reprocessing
OL,11,Fsystem."
